OL,3,GNEWSADate confirmed for start of tips
OL,4,Abooking system
OL,5,
OL,6,FA date has been confirmed for when
OL,7,Fbookings can start being made for
OL,8,Fvisits to Lincolnshire's tips.
OL,10,FThe county council said people would be
OL,11,Fable to book slots from 30 November,
OL,12,Fwith the system getting under way on 7
OL,13,FDecember.
OL,15,FThe scheme is being introduced at the
OL,16,Fcounty's 11 tips in a bid to reduce
OL,17,Fqueues.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
