OL,3,GNEWSADate confirmed for start of tips
OL,4,Abooking system
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere has been some criticism of the
OL,7,Fmove, but Danny Brookes, a member of
OL,8,Fthe council's executive, said: "People
OL,9,Fdon't like change. This is one of the
OL,10,Fbiggest reasons why people don't like
OL,11,Fit. You've got to give it a chance,
OL,12,Fwe've got to do something."
